1.66万亿元。\n\n前两天还在为反弹高兴的投资者，今天又感受到了市场的压力。", "url": "https://x.com/Tebilan986/status/2118621012539629780"}, {"author_id": "1966128647930261506", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:03:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118494502264471978"], "id": "2118494502264471978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 303, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11.06盘前必读：费半暴跌定调光伏扛旗，A股究竟是黄金坑还是诱多陷阱？\n \n一、前言\n \n股价涨跌从来不是单一消息决定，技术形态、资金流向、市场情绪多维共振，才是判断趋势的核心依据。", "url": "https://x.com/minnikaori/status/2118494502264471978"}, {"author_id": "2099777074248716288", "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:24:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118620443439768010"], "id": "2118620443439768010", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 166, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【全球财经热点】\n1、根据TrendForce集邦咨询最新AI Infra（AI基础设施）产业研究，随着AI服务器集群持续扩张、加速器带宽需求快速提升，预估全球AI网络与互连（AI Networking &amp; Interconnect）产值将由2024年的379亿美元，成长至2027年的2,798亿美元\n\n2、伊朗革命卫队：霍尔木兹海峡两艘油轮起火。", "url": "https://x.com/Erica_Liu66/status/2118620443439768010"}, {"author_id": "1944775093676077056", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:46:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118505267448930340"], "id": "2118505267448930340", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 902, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【11月6日A股盘前分析：今日A股大概率大幅低开 全天以震荡消化外围利空为主】", "url": "https://x.com/KennethHal67110/status/2118505267448930340"}, {"author_id": "1753028338070032384", "created_at": "2026-11-06T11:57:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118674055079591940"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hjJLTVR12u", "end": 189, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/FBIFVIS/status/2118674055079591940/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118674044472139776", "start": 166, "url": "https://t.co/hjJLTVR12u"}]}, "id": "2118674055079591940", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_co